 za 5 000 000 K\\u010D, banka p\\u016Fj\\u010D\\xED 4 000 000 K\\u010D. LTV = 80 %. Vlastn\\xED kapit\\xE1l je 1 000 000 K\\u010D (20 %).\",howCalculated:\"LTV (%) = (v\\xFD\\u0161e \\xFAv\\u011Bru \\xF7 z\\xE1stavn\\xED / odhadn\\xED hodnota) \\xD7 100. Banka po\\u010D\\xEDt\\xE1 z odhadu, ne nutn\\u011B z kupn\\xED ceny.\",bankOrInvestor:\"Banka sleduje LTV jako limit rizika. U vlastn\\xEDho bydlen\\xED b\\xFDv\\xE1 horn\\xED r\\xE1mec kolem 80 % (u mlad\\u0161\\xEDch \\u017Eadatel\\u016F n\\u011Bkdy v\\xFD\\u0161e dle intern\\xEDch pravidel). U investic b\\xFDv\\xE1 p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED. Investor LTV pou\\u017E\\xEDv\\xE1 i jako m\\u011B\\u0159\\xEDtko p\\xE1ky a cushion p\\u0159i poklesu cen.\",commonMistake:\"Zam\\u011Bnit kupn\\xED cenu za odhadn\\xED. Kdy\\u017E odhad vyjde n\\xED\\u017E, LTV vysko\\u010D\\xED a rozd\\xEDl dopl\\xE1c\\xEDte z vlastn\\xEDch zdroj\\u016F.\",calculator:\"ltv\",quiz:[{id:\"ltv-q1\",prompt:\"\\xDAv\\u011Br 4 mil. K\\u010D, odhad 5 mil. K\\u010D. Jak\\xE9 je LTV?\",options:[\"70 %\",\"80 %\",\"90 %\",\"125 %\"],correctIndex:1,explain:\"4 \\xF7 5 = 0,8 \\u2192 80 %.\"},{id:\"ltv-q2\",prompt:\"Co banka typicky pou\\u017Eije ve jmenovateli LTV?\",options:[\"Jen kupn\\xED cenu z inzer\\xE1tu\",\"Odhadn\\xED / z\\xE1stavn\\xED hodnotu\",\"Cenu z Majetio sk\\xF3re\",\"Cenu po 10 letech\"],correctIndex:1,explain:\"Rozhoduje odhad banky (z\\xE1stavn\\xED hodnota), ne marketingov\\xE1 cena.\"}],faq:[{q:\"Je LTV 80 % schv\\xE1len\\xED hypot\\xE9ky?\",a:\"Ne. LTV je jen jeden parametr. Banka posuzuje i p\\u0159\\xEDjmy, z\\xE1vazky a \\xFA\\u010Del.\"},{q:\"Po\\u010D\\xEDt\\xE1 se LTV z kupn\\xED nebo odhadn\\xED ceny?\",a:\"Z odhadn\\xED / z\\xE1stavn\\xED hodnoty. Kupn\\xED cena m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED \\u2014 rozd\\xEDl jdete cash.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Metodika dat Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B (LTV)\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika},{label:\"Makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED r\\xE1mec \\u010CNB (editorial / VERIFIED dle katalogu)\",note:\"Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED limity ov\\u011B\\u0159ujte u aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDch doporu\\u010Den\\xED \\u010CNB a banky.\"}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru},{label:\"Kalkula\\u010Dky\",href:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.root}],cta:{label:\"Spo\\u010D\\xEDtat orienta\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}}),lesson({slug:\"rpsn\",title:\"RPSN\",shortLabel:\"RPSN\",description:\"Ro\\u010Dn\\xED procentn\\xED sazba n\\xE1klad\\u016F \\u2014 srovn\\xE1vac\\xED cena \\xFAv\\u011Bru v\\u010Detn\\u011B poplatk\\u016F.\",simplySaid:\"RPSN je poctiv\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED \\u010D\\xEDslo ne\\u017E samotn\\xFD \\xFArok. \\u0158\\xEDk\\xE1, kolik v\\xE1s \\xFAv\\u011Br stoj\\xED za rok v\\u010Detn\\u011B povinn\\xFDch poplatk\\u016F.\",realExample:\"\\xDArok 4 %, ale s odhadem, zpracov\\xE1n\\xEDm a veden\\xEDm \\xFA\\u010Dtu je RPSN 4,3 %. U dvou nab\\xEDdek se stejn\\xFDm \\xFArokem \\u010Dasto vyhraje ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED RPSN.\",howCalculated:\"RPSN je z\\xE1konn\\xFD ukazatel zahrnuj\\xEDc\\xED \\xFArok i povinn\\xE9 n\\xE1klady spojen\\xE9 s \\xFAv\\u011Brem. P\\u0159esn\\xFD vzorec je regulovan\\xFD \\u2014 na port\\xE1lu RPSN nevym\\xFD\\u0161l\\xEDme, bereme ze zdroje banky, nebo zobraz\\xEDme \\u201ENa vy\\u017E\\xE1d\\xE1n\\xED\\u201C.\",bankOrInvestor:\"Banka i zprost\\u0159edkovatel RPSN pou\\u017E\\xEDvaj\\xED ke srovn\\xE1n\\xED nab\\xEDdek. Velk\\xFD odstup RPSN od sazby = hledejte poplatky. Investor porovn\\xE1v\\xE1 RPSN s o\\u010Dek\\xE1van\\xFDm v\\xFDnosem aktiva.\",commonMistake:\"Vybrat hypot\\xE9ku jen podle nejni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED sazby a ignorovat poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED, odhad a poplatky za \\u010Derp\\xE1n\\xED.\",calculator:\"none\",quiz:[{id:\"rpsn-q1\",prompt:\"Co RPSN typicky zahrnuje nav\\xEDc oproti \\xFArokov\\xE9 sazb\\u011B?\",options:[\"Jen inflaci\",\"Povinn\\xE9 poplatky a n\\xE1klady \\xFAv\\u011Bru\",\"Da\\u0148 z nemovitosti\",\"Service charges v Dubaji\"],correctIndex:1,explain:\"RPSN = sazba + povinn\\xE9 n\\xE1klady \\xFAv\\u011Bru dle regulace.\"}],faq:[{q:\"Pro\\u010D n\\u011Bkdy RPSN neukazujeme?\",a:\"Kdy\\u017E nen\\xED ve zdroji banky, nevym\\xFD\\u0161l\\xEDme ho \\u2014 status \\u201ENa vy\\u017E\\xE1d\\xE1n\\xED\\u201C / MODEL.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Metodika RPSN\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED kalkula\\u010Dka\",href:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.root}],cta:{label:\"Porovnat nab\\xEDdky v kalkula\\u010Dce\",href:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.root}}),lesson({slug:\"fixace\",title:\"Fixace \\xFArokov\\xE9 sazby\",shortLabel:\"Fixace\",description:\"Obdob\\xED, po kter\\xE9 m\\xE1te zam\\u010Denou sazbu a spl\\xE1tku.\",simplySaid:\"Fixace je z\\xE1mek sazby na domluvenou dobu. V\\xEDte, kolik plat\\xEDte \\u2014 po konci p\\u0159ijde nov\\xE1 nab\\xEDdka nebo refinancov\\xE1n\\xED.\",realExample:\"Sazba 4,5 % a fixace 5 let. P\\u011Bt let stejn\\xE1 anuita. V 6. roce banka nab\\xEDdne novou sazbu \\u2014 nebo odejdete ke konkurenci.\",howCalculated:\"B\\u011Bhem fixace je sazba smluvn\\u011B dan\\xE1. Spl\\xE1tku po\\u010D\\xEDt\\xE1 anuita z jistiny, sazby a splatnosti. Po fixaci se sazba p\\u0159ece\\u0148uje \\u2014 modelujte citlivost +1 / +2 p.b.\",bankOrInvestor:\"Del\\u0161\\xED fixace \\u010Dasto stoj\\xED o n\\u011Bco v\\xEDc. Banka sleduje konec fixace jako moment refinancov\\xE1n\\xED. Investor vol\\xED fixaci podle horizontu dr\\u017Een\\xED aktiva.\",commonMistake:\"Vz\\xEDt nejdel\\u0161\\xED fixaci \\u201Epro jistotu\\u201C bez pl\\xE1nu prodeje a mimo\\u0159\\xE1dn\\xFDch spl\\xE1tek.\",calculator:\"none\",quiz:[{id:\"fix-q1\",prompt:\"Co se stane po konci fixace?\",options:[\"\\xDAv\\u011Br automaticky zanikne\",\"Banka nab\\xEDdne novou sazbu / m\\u016F\\u017Eete refinancovat\",\"LTV se vynuluje\",\"RPSN zmiz\\xED\"],correctIndex:1,explain:\"Konec fixace = repricing nebo odchod ke konkurenci.\"}],faq:[{q:\"Je del\\u0161\\xED fixace v\\u017Edy lep\\u0161\\xED?\",a:\"Ne. Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na pl\\xE1nu prodeje, refinancov\\xE1n\\xED a cen\\u011B del\\u0161\\xED jistoty.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Metodika sazeb\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}],cta:{label:\"P\\u0159ipravit se na refinancov\\xE1n\\xED\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}}),lesson({slug:\"dti\",title:\"DTI (dluh k p\\u0159\\xEDjmu)\",shortLabel:\"DTI\",description:\"Pom\\u011Br celkov\\xE9ho dluhu k ro\\u010Dn\\xEDmu p\\u0159\\xEDjmu.\",simplySaid:\"DTI \\u0159\\xEDk\\xE1, kolikr\\xE1t je v\\xE1\\u0161 celkov\\xFD dluh v\\u011Bt\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E v\\xE1\\u0161 ro\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem. Je to pohled \\u201Ejak velk\\xFD batoh dluh\\u016F nesete\\u201C.\",realExample:\"Ro\\u010Dn\\xED \\u010Dist\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem 600 000 K\\u010D, celkov\\xE9 dluhy 3 600 000 K\\u010D. DTI = 6.\",howCalculated:\"DTI = celkov\\xFD z\\u016Fstatek dluh\\u016F \\xF7 ro\\u010Dn\\xED \\u010Dist\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem. (N\\u011Bkdy banky pou\\u017E\\xEDvaj\\xED hrub\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem \\u2014 v\\u017Edy ov\\u011B\\u0159te metodiku konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky.)\",bankOrInvestor:\"\\u010CNB m\\u016F\\u017Ee DTI pou\\u017E\\xEDvat jako makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED ukazatel; aktivace se m\\u011Bn\\xED v \\u010Dase. Banky maj\\xED i intern\\xED limity. U investic b\\xFDvaj\\xED doporu\\u010Den\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED. Investor DTI \\u010Dte jako leverage dom\\xE1cnosti.\",commonMistake:\"Po\\u010D\\xEDtat jen hypot\\xE9ku a zapomenout spot\\u0159eb\\xE1ky, leasing a limity karet.\",calculator:\"dti\",quiz:[{id:\"dti-q1\",prompt:\"Dluhy 3,6 mil., ro\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem 0,6 mil. DTI je:\",options:[\"0,6\",\"3\",\"6\",\"60 %\"],correctIndex:2,explain:\"3,6 \\xF7 0,6 = 6.\"}],faq:[{q:\"Je DTI tot\\xE9\\u017E co DSTI?\",a:\"Ne. DTI = stav dluhu k ro\\u010Dn\\xEDmu p\\u0159\\xEDjmu. DSTI = m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xED spl\\xE1tky k m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xEDmu p\\u0159\\xEDjmu.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Metodika LTV/DTI\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika,note:\"Aktu\\xE1ln\\xED aktivaci limit\\u016F \\u010CNB ov\\u011B\\u0159ujte u prim\\xE1rn\\xEDho zdroje.\"}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}],cta:{label:\"Ov\\u011B\\u0159it orienta\\u010Dn\\xED z\\xE1vazky\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}}),lesson({slug:\"dsti\",title:\"DSTI (dluhov\\xE1 slu\\u017Eba k p\\u0159\\xEDjmu)\",shortLabel:\"DSTI\",description:\"Pod\\xEDl m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xEDch spl\\xE1tek na \\u010Dist\\xFDch p\\u0159\\xEDjmech.\",simplySaid:\"DSTI \\u0159\\xEDk\\xE1, kolik procent z v\\xFDplaty padne na spl\\xE1tky v\\u0161ech dluh\\u016F. Banka kontroluje, jestli v\\xE1m zb\\xFDv\\xE1 na \\u017Eivot.\",realExample:\"\\u010Cist\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem 50 000 K\\u010D, hypot\\xE9ka 18 000 K\\u010D + kreditka 2 000 K\\u010D. DSTI = 40 %.\",howCalculated:\"DSTI (%) = (sou\\u010Det m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xEDch spl\\xE1tek \\xF7 \\u010Dist\\xFD m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem) \\xD7 100. Po\\u010D\\xEDtaj\\xED se hypot\\xE9ka, spot\\u0159eb\\xE1k, leasing, \\u010Dasto i minimum z kreditky.\",bankOrInvestor:\"DSTI je b\\u011B\\u017En\\xFD intern\\xED stres-test. Makro limity \\u010CNB se v \\u010Dase m\\u011Bn\\xED; banky ukazatel sleduj\\xED i bez plo\\u0161n\\xE9 aktivace. Investor DSTI pou\\u017E\\xEDv\\xE1 i u cash-flow sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159\\u016F bez n\\xE1jmu.\",commonMistake:\"Zapomenout na kreditky a kontokorenty \\u2014 nevyu\\u017Eit\\xFD limit m\\u016F\\u017Ee sn\\xED\\u017Eit max. \\xFAv\\u011Br.\",calculator:\"dsti\",quiz:[{id:\"dsti-q1\",prompt:\"P\\u0159\\xEDjem 50 tis., spl\\xE1tky 20 tis. DSTI je:\",options:[\"20 %\",\"40 %\",\"50 %\",\"2,5\"],correctIndex:1,explain:\"20 / 50 = 0,4 \\u2192 40 %.\"}],faq:[{q:\"Jak\\xFD DSTI je \\u201Ebezpe\\u010Dn\\xFD\\u201C?\",a:\"Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na bance a \\xFA\\u010Delu. Orienta\\u010Dn\\u011B se \\u010Dasto pracuje s p\\xE1smem kolem 40\\u201345 % \\u2014 ne jako slib schv\\xE1len\\xED.\"}],sources:[{label:\"Metodika\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru},{label:\"Zjistit moje mo\\u017Enosti\",href:\"/moje-moznosti\"}],cta:{label:\"Spo\\u010D\\xEDtat p\\u0159ipravenost\",href:import_routes.routes.navrhNaMiru}}),lesson({slug:\"americka-hypoteka\",title:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",shortLabel:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",description:\"\\xDAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED v \\u010CR \\u2014 prost\\u0159edky nemus\\xED j\\xEDt jen na koupi t\\xE9\\u017Ee nemovitosti.\",simplySaid:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka je \\xFAv\\u011Br, kde bance ru\\u010D\\xEDte nemovitost\\xED v \\u010CR, ale pen\\xEDze m\\u016F\\u017Eete pou\\u017E\\xEDt \\u0161\\xED\\u0159eji (konsolidace, investice, zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED koup\\u011B \\u2014 dle podm\\xEDnek banky).\",realExample:\"M\\xE1te byt v Praze s equity 2 mil. K\\u010D. Banka v\\xE1m proti z\\xE1stav\\u011B p\\u016Fj\\u010D\\xED \\u010D\\xE1st hodnoty \\u2014 pen\\xEDze pou\\u017Eijete nap\\u0159\\xEDklad na akontaci v zahrani\\u010D\\xED (produkt a \\xFA\\u010Del v\\u017Edy dle smlouvy).\",howCalculated:\"Orienta\\u010Dn\\u011B: max. \\xFAv\\u011Br \\u2248 LTV r\\xE1mec \\xD7 odhad nemovitosti \\u2212 st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED z\\xE1stavy. Sazba bereme ze \\u017Eiv\\xFDch dat bank (american_*), pokud jsou LIVE.\",bankOrInvestor:\"Banka zkoum\\xE1 \\xFA\\u010Del, LTV na zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED a bonitu stejn\\u011B pe\\u010Dliv\\u011B jako u klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky. Investor ji \\u010Dasto pou\\u017E\\xEDv\\xE1 jako most k zahrani\\u010Dn\\xEDmu aktivu bez lok\\xE1ln\\xED hypot\\xE9ky.\",commonMistake:\"P\\u0159edpokl\\xE1dat, \\u017Ee \\u201Eamerick\\xE1\\u201C automaticky financuje 80 % zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED nemovitosti. Zaji\\u0161t\\u01